# Accuenergy AcuRev 1300.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Accuenergy AcuRev 1300 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: accuenergy-acurev-1300-modbus-manual.pdf (SunSpec-compatible interface)
# | - 3-phase power meter with SunSpec AC Measurements block.
# | - FC03 (Read Holding Registers) for all registers listed here.
# | - All addresses are raw protocol addresses (0x1047 = 4167 decimal).
# | - Real-time: int16 (s16, 1 register) SunSpec format; each group has a sunssf
# | scale-factor register (also s16) whose value is a power-of-10 exponent;
# | true value = register × 10^sunssf.  Scale=1 here — apply sunssf at runtime.
# | - Energy accumulators (acc32, u32, 2 registers) — no sunssf, direct Wh / varh.
# | - TOU energy bank at 0x0900H (2304 decimal): Dword u32, real = Rx/100 → scale=0.01 kWh.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Accuenergy
@model=AcuRev 1300
@vendor_website=accuenergy.com
@description=3-phase SunSpec power meter — V/I/P/Q/S/PF (s16 with sunssf scale factors at FC03 0x1047 block), energy acc32, TOU energy Dword Rx/100 kWh at 0x0900 (Big-Endian).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/accuenergy-acurev-1300.toml; Source: accuenergy-acurev-1300-modbus-manual.pdf (SunSpec-compatible interface). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

